{%- comment -%}
  Why — one band of the OW Landing page, split out of
  sections/ow-landing.liquid when that section moved to theme blocks so the
  products band could own its cards as real children. Three-column statement of what we do about it.

  Layout lives in assets/ow-landing.css and behaviour in assets/ow-landing.js;
  both key off the class names and ids in this markup, so do not rename them.
{%- endcomment -%}

<section class="why" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="why-inner fade-up">
    {%- comment -%}
      The line break carries class="br-desktop" — it only applies above the
      desktop breakpoint, so the heading is two settings rather than one.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <h3 class="h3">{{ block.settings.heading_line1 }}<br class="br-desktop"> {{ block.settings.heading_line2 }}</h3>
    <p class="why-intro paragraph">{{ block.settings.intro }}</p>
    <div class="why-cols">
      <div class="why-col">
        <div class="why-col-icon" role="img" aria-label="{{ block.settings.col1_title | escape }}">
          <img src="{{ 'ow-why-icon-regen.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="60" height="60">
        </div>
        <h3 class="why-col-title">{{ block.settings.col1_title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ block.settings.col1_body }}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-col">
        <div class="why-col-icon">
          <img src="{{ 'ow-badge-1ftp.png' | asset_url }}" alt="{{ block.settings.col2_title | escape }}" width="376" height="160" style="height:52px;width:auto;">
        </div>
        <h3 class="why-col-title">{{ block.settings.col2_title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ block.settings.col2_body }}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-col">
        <div class="why-col-icon">
          <img src="{{ 'ow-badge-recyclable.png' | asset_url }}" alt="{{ block.settings.col3_title | escape }}" width="160" height="160" style="height:48px;width:auto;">
        </div>
        <h3 class="why-col-title">{{ block.settings.col3_title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ block.settings.col3_body }}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Why",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading_line1",
      "label": "Heading line 1",
      "default": "There are many reasons to give a damn."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading_line2",
      "label": "Heading line 2",
      "default": "And we don't need the same reasons."
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "intro",
      "label": "Intro",
      "default": "Maybe you're here for the vibes and adventure. Or for a damn good cup of coffee. And you don't have to care about the climate for any of that, but there's one thing none of us can opt out of: everything that sustains the fun in this world runs on healthy ecosystems. So drink like you give a damn, whatever your reason. And we will do our part:"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Column 1"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "col1_title",
      "label": "Title",
      "default": "Regenerative Farming"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "col1_body",
      "label": "Body",
      "default": "Soil health is nurtured by the farmers we grow alongside, season after season, through regenerative agriculture: our direct mechanism for better food and climate resilience."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Column 2"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "col2_title",
      "label": "Title",
      "default": "1% for the Planet"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "col2_body",
      "label": "Body",
      "default": "Regenerative farming is just one part of caring for our planet. As members of 1% for the Planet, we give at minimum one percent of annual sales to environmental organisations working hard beyond our own supply chains."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Column 3"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "col3_title",
      "label": "Title",
      "default": "Fully Recyclable"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "col3_body",
      "label": "Body",
      "default": "Pretty \"paper\" bags that can't be recycled. BS \"compostable\" claims that don't actually degrade. None of that is eco-friendly. It's plain greenwashing. Ours is fully recyclable: one PE material from start to finish."
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
